    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Plot Summary\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer comes and goes, and changes come quietly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Character Introduction\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/233e15bfb23905c25483f06c7a4b3a07.avif?t=1755425782\" width=450 height=581 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wan Jing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright and cheerful, approachable top student with outstanding looks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpectedly casual, but a little impatient.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her hobbies are singing and badminton. Although they are just hobbies, her abilities are also outstanding.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She is very popular, so she was asked by the class teacher to tutor his deskmate in the new semester, and she seems to have no objection to such a tough &quot;request&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/794d93d5163c38dce9b187ae21a1a9df.avif?t=1755425782\" width=450 height=581 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Xu Lianxia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she has an impeccable face, she is a loner, so she has no sense of existence in the class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She lives his life drifting with the crowd, and her only hobbies are watching movies and playing games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her grades are not good, so she was entrusted to Wan Jing by the class teacher, hoping to make progress under Wan Jing's tutoring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that she has known Wan Jing since before the third year of high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/39624068723b1829386a02231f064406.avif?t=1755425782\" width=450 height=581 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Jing Xingxi</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively, loyal girl who has been good friends with Wan Jing since elementary school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although she looks a bit irritable, she is surprisingly reliable in some aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have many hobbies and know a little about all fields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It seems that she has been dissatisfied with a certain idea of \u200b\u200bWan Jing since junior high school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3589940/extras/da7a7bce286b7e5dc3049adcfa4aa6b2.avif?t=1755425782\" width=450 height=581 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\uff1f\uff1f\uff1f</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > ???'s elder sister, had a big fight with ??? about something in the second year of high school, and started a cold war since then.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010Game Features\u3011</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Short to medium-length plot, nearly 150,000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Exquisite character portraits and CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7Single ending, dual heroine perspectives bring immersive experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is completely independently made by myself. If you have any questions, please contact me via email: <a href=\"mailto:llx31124945@163.com\">llx31124945@163.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also welcome to join the game exchange group: 1025844034</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
